# #5837, a5e2e2ef's MF1 (#5837 comment 6659146662): the response to the receiver's own
# append of its donor's forward carries the donor's staleHigh, as every routed response does.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestForwardIntoLOmitsStaleReport
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the response to L's append of its donor's forward omits staleHigh, so a stale D''s earlier forward of L's key is missed and L free-advances past it unapplied
PERTURBS: ForwardIntoL
BOUNDS: WithFreeAdvance = TRUE, WithForwardIn = TRUE, WithSplitBirth = TRUE, WithDonorRestart = TRUE, WithKeyMove = TRUE, WithDuplicate = FALSE, WithMixedVersion = FALSE

--- FIND
    /\ ReportForeign(a)
    /\ ReportStale(a)
    /\ UNCHANGED <<durable, acked, floor, leafVars, epochVars, handVars, envVars, moveVars>>
    /\ UNCHANGED <<lastU, oldUsed, restarted, oldRejected>>
    /\ UNCHANGED <<preArm, startHead, evStart, evFloor, ft, sh, sibHint, sibRows, xferVars, svVars>>
--- REPLACE
    /\ ReportForeign(a)
\* MUTATION: the response carries no staleHigh.
    /\ UNCHANGED <<durable, acked, floor, leafVars, epochVars, handVars, envVars, moveVars>>
    /\ UNCHANGED <<lastU, oldUsed, restarted, oldRejected>>
    /\ UNCHANGED <<preArm, startHead, evStart, evFloor, seenS, ft, sh, sibHint, sibRows, xferVars, svVars>>
--- END
